      "id": "L-STACK-06",
      "answer": "Follow wrapped rows (Recommended)",
      "decision": "Automatic Stack separators appear only between neighbouring items on the same visible flex line. Apply equivalent behavior for a vertical Stack wrapping into columns. Suppress outer-edge dividers, retain selected per-side spacing for visible dividers, and verify resize/hide/reorder and all three engines. Does not change Group member-order joined-corner rules.",
      "persisted": true,
      "status": "CONFIRMED"
    }
